  "content": "<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.creeperhost.net%252fapplyPromo%252fHomeGrownMods\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/551524/description_b4793894-122c-49e4-8107-caaa82fe43d7.png\"></strong></a></p><p><strong>这是&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/Steves_Carts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Vswe</a>&nbsp;的史蒂夫矿车2模组的延续，移植基于&nbsp;</strong><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/steves-carts-reborn\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>史蒂夫矿车重生</strong></a></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>史蒂夫矿车允许玩家自定义和设计用于自动化的矿车。&nbsp;&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/625/936/2023-02-23_13.png\" width=\"1125\" height=\"620\"></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>所有功劳归功于Vswe，他是原版史蒂夫矿车模组的作者。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>已获得VSWE的许可</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/651/732/image.png\"></p>",
